ICON FILES NEEDED:

This folder requires icon files in PNG format:

1. icon-16.png (16x16 pixels)
   - Used for browser toolbar
   - Appears in tab favicons

2. icon-48.png (48x48 pixels)
   - Used in extension management page
   - Used in some UI elements

3. icon-128.png (128x128 pixels)
   - Used for high-DPI displays
   - Used in Chrome Web Store

DESIGN RECOMMENDATIONS:

- Use the shield emoji concept (🛡️) or custom design
- Maintain clarity at small sizes
- Use the brand colors: #667eea (primary) and #764ba2 (secondary)
- Ensure good contrast for visibility
- Add transparency for professional look

QUICK ICON GENERATION:

You can:
1. Use an online icon generator (e.g., favicon.io)
2. Create custom icons in Figma/Photoshop
3. Use the existing emoji as placeholder
4. Commission a designer for professional icons

The extension will work with or without proper icons, but they improve user experience.

For development/testing, temporary 1x1 pixel PNG files can be used.
